00:30:26,520 --> 00:30:29,920
I remember this, because we had exactly this meeting, our

681
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:31,260
little company.

682
00:30:31,260 --> 00:30:33,010
We gave shares to all

683
00:30:33,010 --> 00:30:34,760
of our employees to motivate them.

684
00:30:34,760 --> 00:30:36,400
Everyone's a shareholder.

685
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:37,920
But they had tiny numbers.

686
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:40,040
Some of them had very little shares.

687
00:30:40,040 --> 00:30:41,660
And we had a board meeting,

688
00:30:41,660 --> 00:30:43,280
and we said, we've never paid

689
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:45,400
a dividend.

690
00:30:45,400 --> 00:30:46,280
Should we do it?

691
00:30:46,280 --> 00:30:47,920
Should we pay a dividend?

692
00:30:47,920 --> 00:30:50,680
And then we had a discussion.

693
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:53,260
And someone said, well, you know, all these employees

694
00:30:53,260 --> 00:30:55,360
wonder if their shares are worth anything.

695
00:30:55,360 --> 00:30:56,640
So maybe if they got a

696
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:57,920
check in the mail, they'd feel

697
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:59,160
better.

698
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:00,920
But you see, the dividend

699
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:02,680
is subject to the discretion of

700
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:03,740
the company.

701
00:31:03,740 --> 00:31:09,160
Ultimately, people own shares to get dividends, right?

702
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:13,920
Because the dividends is the distribution of profits.

703
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:15,920
If a company is going to

704
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:17,920
pay a dividend, it's going to pay

705
00:31:17,920 --> 00:31:18,920
dividends.

706
00:31:18,920 --> 00:31:21,420
If a company never distributed

707
00:31:21,420 --> 00:31:23,920
dividends, it would be like a

708
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:25,920
nonprofit, right?

709
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:28,680
If they kept all the profits, they can do that.

710
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:30,680
There's no law saying that

711
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:32,680
they have to distribute dividends.

712
00:31:32,680 --> 00:31:33,680
They can just keep it

713
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:34,680
in the company, and like Yale

714
00:31:34,680 --> 00:31:38,680
University, get a huge endowment and just let it get

715
00:31:38,680 --> 00:31:41,680
bigger and bigger.

716
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:43,180
But the whole purpose of

717
00:31:43,180 --> 00:31:44,680
a for-profit company is to pay

718
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:45,680
dividends.

719
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:47,720
Sooner or later, they do it.

720
00:31:47,720 --> 00:31:50,720
But the big problem is, the for-profit companies don't pay

721
00:31:50,720 --> 00:31:51,720
dividends.

722
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:52,720
Why not?

723
00:31:52,720 --> 00:31:54,720
Because everybody knows that our money is in the future.

724
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:55,720
We're starting up.

725
00:31:55,720 --> 00:31:57,720
We're not making a lot of money.

726
00:31:57,720 --> 00:32:00,720
In the future, we'll have a lot of money.

727
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:04,720
So let's pay dividends later.

728
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:07,720
For example, Microsoft, that I'm going to describe, went

729
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:10,720
through decades without ever paying a dividend.

730
00:32:10,720 --> 00:32:13,720
They just kept plowing it back into the company.

731
00:32:13,720 --> 00:32:14,720
Now, if you knew that

732
00:32:14,720 --> 00:32:15,720
they would never pay a dividend,

733
00:32:15,720 --> 00:32:17,720
then you wouldn't want to own Microsoft shares.

734
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:19,720
You'd think, well, eventually they're going to.

735
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:21,720
And so, that's why you own the company.

736
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:23,720
But this is a very common misunderstanding.

737
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:25,720
A lot of people think that

738
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:27,720
you buy stocks because the price

739
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:30,720
will go up.

740
00:32:30,720 --> 00:32:32,220
Well, the price will go

741
00:32:32,220 --> 00:32:33,720
up only because people think there

742
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:35,720
are more dividends coming.

