00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:37,720
At least in theory, that's the way it should be.

744
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:39,720
The price ought to be,

745
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:41,720
we'll question this later, but it

746
00:32:41,720 --> 00:32:45,720
ought to be the present value of expected future dividends.

747
00:32:45,720 --> 00:32:47,220
So, the true value of

748
00:32:47,220 --> 00:32:48,720
a company is entirely in the

749
00:32:48,720 --> 00:32:49,720
dividends.

750
00:32:49,720 --> 00:32:52,720
It seems a little funny, because you think, well, the

751
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:55,720
board of directors doesn't have to pay a dividend.

752
00:32:55,720 --> 00:32:57,220
And they could just get

753
00:32:57,220 --> 00:32:58,720
nasty and never pay it out.

754
00:32:58,720 --> 00:33:01,720
But remember, you elect the board of directors.

755
00:33:01,720 --> 00:33:03,720
And so, if you're frustrated that our company is

756
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:05,220
accumulating lots of money and it's

