00:33:43,720 --> 00:33:46,720
It's called the ex-dividend price.

779
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:48,720
And they show it in newspaper.

780
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:49,720
Well, they don't do it in

781
00:33:49,720 --> 00:33:50,720
– they used to show it in

782
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:51,720
newspapers.

783
00:33:51,720 --> 00:33:52,720
Now, it would be on the website.

784
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:54,220
They put a little x by the

785
00:33:54,220 --> 00:33:55,720
stock price on the day after a

786
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:57,720
