789
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:05,720
It doesn't mean there's bad news about the company.

790
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:07,720
It just means they just paid a dividend.

791
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:09,219
So, the price routinely goes

792
00:34:09,219 --> 00:34:10,719
down by the amount of the

793
00:34:10,719 --> 00:34:11,719
