00:34:52,719 --> 00:34:55,719
So, you don't have to worry about dividend payment dates,

815
00:34:55,719 --> 00:35:00,720
because the stock price jumps down right after a dividend.

816
00:35:00,720 --> 00:35:02,720
So, it doesn't matter with

817
00:35:02,720 --> 00:35:04,720
you, except maybe if some second

818
00:35:04,720 --> 00:35:09,720
order effects, it doesn't matter with you by a dividend

819
00:35:09,720 --> 00:35:11,720
or a share.

820
00:35:11,720 --> 00:35:12,720
It doesn't matter.

821
00:35:12,720 --> 00:35:14,720
It doesn't matter if you're going

822
00:35:14,720 --> 00:35:16,720
to buy it before or after

823
00:35:16,720 --> 00:35:17,720
a dividend.

824
00:35:17,720 --> 00:35:19,720
All right, so you see the idea here.

825
00:35:19,720 --> 00:35:21,720
The idea of a corporation is,

826
00:35:21,720 --> 00:35:23,720
we have these shares, and the

827
00:35:23,720 --> 00:35:25,720
shares are always saleable.

828
00:35:25,720 --> 00:35:28,220
So, let's say four of us

829
