877
00:37:01,720 --> 00:37:03,720
money.

878
00:37:03,720 --> 00:37:04,720
That's an alternative.

879
00:37:04,720 --> 00:37:06,720
That's called equity financing.

880
00:37:06,720 --> 00:37:08,720
That's an alternative.

881
00:37:08,720 --> 00:37:11,720
So, equity financing is financing by debt.

882
00:37:11,720 --> 00:37:13,720
Your company could also go to

883
00:37:13,720 --> 00:37:15,720
