Extremely expensive for that time.

1410
01:00:09,900 --> 01:00:13,900
But what Carlson invented was a dry copier.

1411
01:00:13,900 --> 01:00:14,900
It used to be that

1412
01:00:14,900 --> 01:00:15,900
what they had to do was

1413
01:00:15,900 --> 01:00:17,900
