1417
01:00:24,900 --> 01:00:26,400
It comes out wet and

1418
01:00:26,400 --> 01:00:27,900
you have to hang it out.

1419
01:00:27,900 --> 01:00:30,900
That was expensive and inconvenient.

1420
01:00:30,900 --> 01:00:32,900
But they did have copying machines.

1421
