But he invented this process that,

1423
01:00:35,900 --> 01:00:38,900
you could take any paper and put it through,

1424
01:00:38,900 --> 01:00:41,900
plain paper, and it would come out hot and dry,

1425
01:00:41,900 --> 01:00:44,900
and cheap.

1426
01:00:44,900 --> 01:00:47,900
So Xerox became an overnight success,

1427
01:00:47,900 --> 01:00:51,900
because they had a patent on Carlson's thing.

1428
01:00:51,900 --> 01:00:53,900
And it became the glamour company

1429
