1447
01:01:41,900 --> 01:01:43,900
And it had a lot

1448
01:01:43,900 --> 01:01:45,900
of advantages over the Xerox copier.

1449
01:01:45,900 --> 01:01:48,900
So the company almost went under.

1450
01:01:48,900 --> 01:01:50,900
So I have, what I

1451
01:01:50,900 --> 01:01:52,900
got here is the balance sheet

1452
